-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §109: a non-academic first deputy is placed at
-- his school's level in the table of his rank — senior certified (י"ט),
-- certified (כ'), uncertified (כ"א) — at the grade or intermediate grade
-- nearest at or above A; §98(ג) applies.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-46`
IMPORT `base-agreement-106`
§ `109 שיבוץ סגן מנהל ראשון שאינו אקדמאי בטבלאות השכר המשולב`

DECLARE `first deputy's rank` IS ONE OF
    `a senior certified first deputy`
    `a certified first deputy`
    `an uncertified first deputy`

@ref akn:art_109__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_109__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_109__para_a__subpara_3
GIVEN r IS A `first deputy's rank`
GIVETH A `non-academic first deputies' table`
DECIDE `the first deputies' table for the rank` r IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `a senior certified first deputy` THEN `the senior certified first deputies' table (annex י"ט)`
    WHEN `a certified first deputy` THEN `the certified first deputies' table (annex כ')`
    WHEN `an uncertified first deputy` THEN `the uncertified first deputies' table (annex כ"א)`

@ref akn:art_109__para_a akn:art_109__para_b
GIVEN a IS A NUMBER, `row of the school's level` IS A LIST OF `grade cell`
GIVETH A MAYBE `grade cell`
DECIDE `a non-academic first deputy's placement` a `row of the school's level` IS
    `the placement in the row` a `row of the school's level`
